### Variáveis Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

# Product

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Get By Bar Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/9788550807348

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelSku": "OS PRIMEIROS 90 DIAS",
  "barCode": "9788550807348"
}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/9788550807348
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelSku": "OS PRIMEIROS 90 DIAS",
  "imageUrl": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SRxyLT28L._SL1442_.jpg"
}